      "text_position": "top",
      "sticker": null
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "role": "context",
      "continues": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "Speed was never the problem. Judgement was."
        }
      ],
      "source_line": null,
      "sticker": null
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "role": "context",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "We built the drafting step first because it was the easy one to build."
        },
        {
          "text": "It filled every section. It never once refused a weak section.",
          "size": "med"
        }
      ],
      "background": {
        "type": "field"
      },
      "artifact": null,
      "artifact_pos": null,
      "source_line": null,
      "text_position": "top",
      "sticker": null
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "role": "detail",
      "continues": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "So we inverted it. The pipeline now has to name what it could not evidence.",
          "size": "med"
        }
      ],
      "source_line": null,
      "sticker": null
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "role": "detail",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "Every section now carries a confidence line and a list of what we asked for and did not get."
        },
        {
          "text": "The gaps are the useful part of the document.",
          "size": "med",
          "highlights": [
            {
              "text": "the useful part",
              "style": "underline"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "background": {
        "type": "field"
      },
      "artifact": "memo-structure-outline.png",
      "artifact_pos": "lower",
      "source_line": null,
      "text_position": "top",
      "sticker": null
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "role": "learned",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "A tool that cannot say what it does not know will hand you a confident memo about nothing."
        },
        {
          "text": "We were wrong to build the writing before the refusing.",
          "size": "med"
        }
      ],
      "background": {
